{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Looking for a Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Soft Skills"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Discuss factual and abstract information about common everyday or job related topics in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le03ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "executive assistant "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the person who helps the company president or CEO in a variety of ways, such as scheduling appointments."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You are a good executive assistant, Denise. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about the skills an employee has."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "get your point across"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to express your ideas clearly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He gets his point across without being aggressive."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to shake up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to make changes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our organization needs shaking up a bit."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "soft skills"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "personal qualities and abilities that are not related to direct training, but more about how a person interacts with others in the workplace"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Which soft skills did you see?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "creativity "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the ability to come up with original ideas"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I also saw evidence of creativity and problem-solving skills."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "problem-solving"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the ability to find solutions to problems"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He showed evidence of creativity and problem-solving skills."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing Necessity: <span class=\"italic\">Need</span> + <span class=\"strong\">Passive Infinitive</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Need</span> + Gerund"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">need</span> + <span class=\"strong\">passive infinitive</span> and <span class=\"italic\">need </span> + verb <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> to talk about things that need to be done.  </br>You use these structures to focus on the thing that needs doing, not the person who is doing it. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">Need</span> + <span class=\"strong\">Passive Infinitive</span>  </br></br><span class=\"italic\">It needs to be said: I like ambitious people. </span></br>The subject of the sentence is the thing that needs doing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">Need</span> + Verb <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>  </br></br><span class=\"italic\">Our organization needs shaking up a bit. </span></br>When you use need with a gerund (verb <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>), it has a passive meaning.  It means that something needs to be done."}, {"type": "example", "content": "He  <span class=\"strong\">needs training</span>, but he has great potential as a journalist."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Once you have established your priorities, they  <span class=\"strong\">need acting on</span>."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Time Clauses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use time clauses to be precise about when an event or action occurred or will occur."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Remember, a clause has its own subject and verb. They can come at the beginning of a sentence (separated by a comma) or at the end of a sentence.</br></br>  Look at the chart as a reference for different words or phrases used in time clauses and their meanings or uses."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Word/Phrase</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning/Use</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ever since\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when things started\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Ever since meeting him, I've been thinking about what he said.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"while, as, whilst, when\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"things happening at the same time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He demonstrated considerable soft skills while we were talking.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"as soon as, before, after, once\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"things happening at the same time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He sees solutions as soon as he sees problems.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I read about soft skills."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write sentences explaining why soft skills are important."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss the importance of various soft skills."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a list of the soft skills that were mentioned in this lesson."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go online. Find 4 - 5 more soft skills."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For each soft skill, write 1 - 2 sentences explaining why this skill is important for finding and keeping a job. You can explain what would happen if the person didn't have this soft skill."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your list and sentences to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, discuss the soft skills and choose the three most important ones."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le03ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le03ob09re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le03ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Martha</span>: Good day, Mr. Brody. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Hello, Ms. Walkers.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Martha</span>: You look very reflective.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Yes. You are a good executive assistant,\nMartha. You can read me well.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Martha</span>: Oh, thank you.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: I just met a young man who wants an editorial assistant position. Ever since meeting him, I've been thinking about what he said.  It needs to be said: I like ambitious people.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Martha</span>: Did you already give that position to someone? A young woman?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le03ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Yes, but you know, there's always room for talented people in our company. He doesn't have a lot of experience, but he demonstrated considerable soft skills while we were talking. He needs training, but he has great potential as a journalist.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Martha</span>: Oh yes? Which soft skills did you see?\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: He was a great communicator.  He gets along well with colleagues, listens and understands instructions, and gets his point across without being aggressive. He needs to be told that's something he's good at.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Martha</span>: Oh, I agree.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>:  I also saw evidence of creativity and problem-solving skills. He sees solutions as soon as he sees problems. Our organization needs shaking up a bit.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Martha</span>: I know.", "id": 2, "time": "25600", "image": "engenn10le03ob09re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Also, I'm sure he is eager to accept responsibility. He takes pride in his work, and he is confident enough to put his name to it.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Martha</span>: What are some other soft skills?\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>:  Well, the ability to work well under pressure is another one. Employers want to know you can put the stress to one side and focus on the job in hand. Once you have established your priorities, they need acting on. I think he can do that.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Martha</span>: It sounds like you have another editorial assistant on your team.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Yes, perhaps you're right.", "id": 3, "time": "69750", "image": "engenn10le03ob09re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can request or report facts about events or actions related to work and jobs."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express necessity and duty about a work-related process."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can exchange opinions about  my academic studies and my work in various time frames."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Soft skills are things like communicating with people, being organized and accepting responsibility. Do you think soft skills are important? Why or why not?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you think you have these soft skills? Why or why not?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Do you have the right soft skills for the job?"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Mr. Brody talks with his executive assistant, Ms. Walkers. He seems very <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">reflective</span>.\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback